    "title": "Clemson basketball assistant Billy Donlon named Eastern Michigan coach",
    "text": "CLEMSONClemson assistant takes Eastern Michigan job, will stay through March Madness Derrian CarterGreenville NewsMarch 17, 2026, 2:53 p.m. ETCLEMSON — Eastern Michigan hired Clemson basketball assistant Billy Donlon as its coach on March 17, the school announced.Donlon spent four seasons at Clemson, working on the team's defense and guard group. He has assisted in the development and recruitment of guards, including Chase Hunter, Dillon Hunter, Jaeden Zackery and Joseph Girard III, that has helped the Tigers make three straight NCAA Tournament appearances.",
